(281,'\"Tropical Breeze\"',0,'<font color=red>This item has been purchased.</font> Close your eyes and feel the warmth of the sun against your skin, the sounds of the ocean waves along the beach and the gentle touch of a tropical breeze.  This yoga bag will carry your yoga mat in style, and carry <b>you</b> away to a place of serenity and calm with beautiful palm trees swaying in the breeze.  This yoga bag is the perfect way to carry your yoga gear, with a large main compartment to carry more than just your mat!  Spacious drawstring opening, 2 pockets, a place to clip your keys, a wide strap for comfort, and fully lined with coordinating fabric.  Measures approximately 30\" high x 14\" wide x 8\" base.  Second photo shows inside of the bag.','tropicalbreeze.jpg','tropicalbreezeCU.jpg',0,18,2),
(274,'\"Phoenix Sun\"',0,'<font color=red>Sorry, this item has been purchased</font>This necklace was inspired by a recent trip to sunny Phoenix Arizona.  The sun charm is STERLING SILVER, and a symbol of energy and life.  The spherical hematite beads are claimed to impart good health and vitality to those who wear it.  This necklace is handcrafted, using high quality beads on a tension mounted wire.  Measures approximately 4.5\" in diameter as shown, and expands to fit around the neck.  The sun charm measures approximately 3/4\" in diameter.','phoenixSun.JPG','phoenixSunCU.JPG',0,18,15),
(275,'\"Om Land\"',0,'<font color=red>Sorry, this item has been purchased</font>\"OmLand\" features a STERLING SILVER Hindu \"Om\" symbol, gently caressed on either side by a series of copper-brown beads (symbolizing the Earth) and dark green beads (symbolizing the life that comes from within the Earth).  Handcrafted using high quality beads on a tension mounted wire. Measures approximately 4.5\" in diameter as shown, and expands to fit around the neck. The silver Om charm measures approximately 3/4\" in width and 1\" in height.','multiOm.JPG','multiOmCU.JPG',0,18,14),
(276,'Hematite Om',28,'Simple and stunning.  This necklace features a STERLING SILVER Hindu \"Om\" symbol on a string of hematite beads, with green accents near the charm.  Hematite is believed to impart a positive healing energy to those who wear it.  Handcrafted using high quality beads on a strong wire, securely attached to a lobster clasp and loop, with an extension chain to let you choose the length.  The necklace, measured from end-to-end is approximately 18\" long. The silver Om charm measures approximately 3/4\" in width and 1\" in height.   Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price.  Will ship worldwide!','hematiteOm.JPG','hematiteOmCU.JPG',0,4,4),
(278,'Sterling Silver Butterfly (SOL',28,'<font color=red>Regular $45.  Special clearance price $28! Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price! </font> <p>Second in the series of STERLING SILVER jewelry.  This necklace features an 18\" long sterling silver chain, and an elegant sterling silver butterfly.  The butterfly\'s wings are adorned with sparkling clear gems, and the delicate details of the charm add character and quality to this unique piece.  \r\n\r\n<p>This necklace will arrive beautifully displayed in a burgundy necklace box, ready for gift giving or wear.  ','silverbfly0001.JPG','silverbflyCU0001.JPG',0,7,3),
(279,'Diaper Backpack & Pad',70,'This backpack is a sample of what I can make for you.  The bag was custom-made for a client wishing to have a roomy bag to carry her toddler\'s diapers, clothes and snacks, but without all the bulk!  2 sippy cup holders on the front of the bag leave the inside of the bag available for the matching change pad and more! The bag also features a small inner pocket for keys and small items, a drawstring top and a magnetic snap closure!  Fully lined.  The diaper pad features a removable cover, and folds up neatly to fit inside the bag.  All machine washable!  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is also available!','laurelsbag1.jpg','laurelsbag2.jpg',0,3,3),
(280,'Hemp Purse',0,'<font color=red> This bag has been purchased.  Use the \"Contact Me\" link at the top right of this page to place a custom order</font>. This hemp purse is simple and stylish.  It can be used as a casual accessory or on a special night out.  The outer material is 100% hemp in a thick black canvas.  The inside of the bag is lined with a luxurious 70% hemp - 30% silk in a soft blue.  There is a magnetic snap closure, and a pretty butterfly detail on the front flap.  The strap is long enough to wear on your shoulder so the bag sits just under your arm, or to be held in your hand without having the bag drag near the ground. Measures approximately 11\"x6\"x2\".  Simply perfect!','barbpurse.jpg','barbpurseIN.jpg',0,18,5),
(283,' \"Aloha\" (SOLD)',28,'<font color=red> Regular $38, CLEARANCE price $28 with shipping to Canada/continental USA included!</font><p>  This yoga bag features a 100% cotton exterior, with swaying palm trees and cascading waterfalls.  A vacation in a bag!  This yoga bag is the perfect way to carry your yoga gear, with a large main compartment to carry more than just your mat!  <p>Spacious drawstring opening, 2 pockets, a place to clip your keys, a wide strap for comfort, fully lined with coordinating fabric and finished off with decorative beading.  Measures approximately 30\" high x 14\" wide x 8\" base.  Second photo shows inside of the bag.','aloha.jpg','alohaCU.jpg',0,7,2),
(284,' \"Violet Dusk\" (SOLD)',38,'Sorry, this item has been purchased.  Please contact me for custom orders.  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is available!  You have to touch and see this bag to believe it.  Made from a soft and luscious velvety material with a subtle floral motif throughout.  This yoga bag is the perfect way to carry your yoga gear, with a large main compartment to carry more than just your mat! Spacious drawstring opening, 2 pockets, a place to clip your keys, a wide strap for comfort, fully lined with coordinating fabric and finished off with decorative beading. Measures approximately 30\" high x 14\" wide x 8\" base. Second photo shows inside of the bag.  ','violetdusk.jpg','violetduskCU.jpg',0,1,6),
(285,'\"Sun-Kissed\" (SOLD)',38,'<font color=red>Sorry, this bag has been purchased.</font>Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is available!  Bright and vibrant!  This bag features energizing bursts of colour.  100% cotton exterior featuring a blooming floral motif with dragonflies and other surprises hidden within. This yoga bag is the perfect way to carry your yoga gear, with a large main compartment to carry more than just your mat! Spacious drawstring opening, 2 pockets, a place to clip your keys, a wide strap for comfort, fully lined with coordinating fabric and finished off with decorative beading. Measures approximately 30\" high x 14\" wide x 8\" base. Second photo shows inside of the bag. ','sunkissed.jpg','sunkissedCU.jpg',0,1,7),
(344,'\"Water\" (SOLD)',18,'<font color=blue>Sorry, this necklace has been purchased.</font> \"Water\" in the Elemental series of one-of-a-kind, handcrafted necklaces. This necklace features the kanji symbol for \"water\", which is embraced on either side by a string of semi-precious gemstone beads. Measures approximately 18\" in length, with a 1\" extension chain secured with a lobster claw clasp and hook. See others in this series, including \"earth\", \"metal\" and \"wood\".','water.JPG','waterCU.JPG',0,4,8),
(346,'\"Om\" Sterling Silver (SOLD)',18,'<font color=blue>Please note, these earrings are a special purchase!  They are the only jewelry items that are not handcrafted. But I thought they were too nice to pass up! Click on the photo for a closer look at the detail!</font></i> \"Om\" ~ the ancient Hindu symbol is beautifully depicted in sterling silver! These gorgeous stud earrings measure approximately 3/8\" wide (just less than 1 cm). The earrings come mounted and packaged in a small gift box, ready to give!','omear.JPG','',0,4,16),
(343,'\"Wood\" Kanji Necklace',18,'\"Wood\" in the Elemental series of one-of-a-kind, handcrafted necklaces. This necklace features the kanji symbol for \"wood\", which is embraced on either side by a row of wooden beads. Measures approximately 18\" in length, with a 1\" extension chain secured with a lobster claw clasp and hook. See others in this series, including \"water\", \"metal\" and \"earth\".','wood.JPG','woodCU.JPG',0,4,6),
(342,'\"Earth\" Kanji Necklace',18,' \"Earth\" in the Elemental series of one-of-a-kind, handcrafted necklaces. This necklace features the kanji symbol for \"earth\", which is embraced on either side by a string of semi-precious gemstone beads. Measures approximately 18\" in length, with a 1\" extension chain secured with a lobster claw clasp and hook. See others in this series, including \"water\", \"metal\" and \"wood\".','earth.JPG','earthCU.JPG',0,4,4),
(288,' \"Barley\" Organic Cotton (SOLD',38,'<font color=red>Sorry, this item has been purchased.</font>Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is available!  This yoga bag features a 100% ORGANIC cotton exterior with red detailing.  Take a peek inside to see a stunning golden green lining, matching inner pocket to keep small items handy, and a convenient key clip! Spacious drawstring opening and a wide strap for comfort, finished off with decorative beading on the drawstring to make this bag truly unique. Measures approximately 13\" wide x 31\" long, plenty of space to fit a standard yoga mat with room to spare for your accessories. ','barley.jpg','barleyIN.jpg',0,1,4),
(289,'\"Blue Dane\" Mat Bag (SOLD)',38,'<font color=blue>Sorry, this bag has been purchased.</font> Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is available! This yoga bag features a cotton-blend exterior with a white, Danish woodstamped pattern throughout. Take a peek inside to see a matching soft blue lining to let your \"sticky\" mat slide in and out easily, an inner pocket to keep small items handy, and a convenient place to clip your keys! Spacious drawstring opening and a wide strap for comfort, finished off with decorative antique golden beads on the drawstring to make this bag truly unique. Measures approximately 12\" wide x 32\" long, plenty of space to fit a standard yoga mat with room to spare for your accessories. ','bluedane.jpg','bluedaneIN.jpg',0,1,3),
(290,'\"Geisha\" Tote',0,'The word Geisha literally translates to “arts person” (gei = art, sha = person), and describes what a Geisha is – a woman trained in the traditional arts of Japan, such as music, dance, and singing. \r\n\r\nThis one-of-a-kind tote features a beautiful, 100% cotton outer fabric, depicting Geishas playing instruments in a field of blossoming cherry trees. The tote measures approximately 12” long x 11” high x 3” wide, with wide straps for comfort. Take a close look, and you’ll see a twinkle of gold dust throughout this gorgeous fabric!  Beautifully detailed with pink satin ribbon on the front. Take a peek inside the bag and you will see a matching pocket to keep those small items from slipping to the bottom of the bag. A magnetic snap closure keeps your belongings secure. All beautifully lined in a stunning gold-green fabric. The bag will come with a description of the meaning of Geishas, as The Geisha Tote honors talented and artistic women around the world. You can purchase this bag as a gift for yourself, or another talented woman in your life. Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is also available!\r\n','geishabag1.jpg','geishabag2.jpg',0,18,9),
(291,'\"Elle\" Purse',0,'<font color=red>Sorry, this item has been purchased. </font>  Elegant simplicity, without frills or fuss.  Classic striped purse in the season\'s best colours, lined with a gorgeous copper-coloured satin, and embellished with a simple bow.  Magnetic snap closure keeps your items secure.  This purse measures approximately 9\" x 7\" x 3\".  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is also available!','stripetote.jpg','stripetoteIN.jpg',0,18,8),
(292,'\"Om\" Tote (SOLD)',32,'<font color=red>This bag has been purchased.</font> This beautiful bag depicts the Hindu symbol \"Om\" on the front pocket.  Made from 100% cotton corduroy, the bag is lined with a matching indigo poly lining.  Wide straps for comfort, and a magnetic snap closure to keep your items secure.  Bag measures approximately 10\" x 11\" x 3\".  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is also available!','omtote.jpg','omtoteIN.jpg',0,3,12),
(293,'\"Downward Dog\" Hemp Tote',32,'This beautiful bag depicts the yoga pose, \"Downward Dog\", embroidered on the front pocket. Made from 100% hemp canvas, the bag is lined with a matching 100% cotton batik lining. Wide straps for comfort, and a magnetic snap closure to keep your items secure.  Bag measures approximately 12\" x 11\" x 3\".  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is also available!','downdogtote.jpg','downdogtoteIN.jpg',0,3,5),
(294,'\"Harvest\" Set',0,'<font color=red>Sorry, this set has been purchased.  Please contact me for custom-made pieces.</font>This necklace and bracelet set features an 18\" necklace and a tension mounted wire bracelet which wraps around the wrist (one size fits most).  The necklace also has a 1\" extension chain so that you can adjust the length easily using the lobster claw clasp and hook closure.  High quality beads were used to create this one-of-a-kind set.   Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price.  Will ship worldwide!','harvest.JPG','harvestCU.JPG',0,18,12),
(295,'\"Amber Sunset\"',0,'<font color=red>Sorry, this necklace set has been purchased.  Please contact me for custom-made pieces.</font>  This necklace and bracelet set features an 18\" necklace and a tension mounted wire bracelet (one size fits most) which wraps around the wrist. The necklace also has a 1\" extension chain so that you can easily adjust the length using the lobster claw clasp and hook closure. High quality beads and spacers were used to create this one-of-a-kind set.  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price.  Will ship worldwide!','amberset.JPG','ambersetCU.JPG',0,18,12),
(296,'\"Rose Quartz\" Set',0,'This necklace and bracelet set features an 18\" necklace and a tension mounted wire bracelet (one size fits most) which wraps around the wrist. The necklace also has a 1\" extension chain so that you can easily adjust the length using the lobster claw clasp and hook closure. High quality, semi-precious Rose Quartz beads were used to create this one-of-a-kind set.  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price.  Will ship worldwide!','rosequart.JPG','rosequartzCU.JPG',0,18,8),
(297,'Set of 5 Produce Bags',18,'100% unbleached cotton produce bags. The environmentally friendly alternative to plastic bags for buying and storing your fruits and vegetables. These bags are also breathable, so moisture doesn’t get trapped causing mold and “slime”, as often happens with plastic bags. \r\nYou will receive 5 handcrafted bags (3 large, 2 small).  Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Worldwide shipping is also available! *Please note: Bags come empty, and may not be exactly as shown in photo.','producebags.jpg','',0,3,11),
(298,'Mini Yoga Bag Keychain!',8,'These adorable yoga mat keychains are the perfect little gift for the yoga enthusiast in your life!  These bags arrive complete with a rolled up \"sticky\" mat inside!  They are made from leftover small pieces of fabric which would otherwise be disposed, so you never know which colour or pattern you\'ll get!  Each one is different and unique.  FREE shipping to Canada/Continental US!','minibag0001.JPG','miniyogabag.JPG',0,8,7),
(365,'\"Copper Dragon\"',18,'Dragon, a symbol of strength and good luck.  This necklace features a handpainted dragon on a ceramic bead.  High quality beads in tones of copper, gold and silver flank either side of the elegant dragon charm.  <p>Handcrafted and securely attached to a lobster clasp and loop. The necklace, measured from end-to-end is approximately 16\" long, with a 2\" extension chain to let you choose the length. <p>\r\n\r\nShipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. ','neckdragon.JPG','neckdragonCU.JPG',0,4,1),
(354,'\"Retro Dots\" Purse',22,'This bag has been carefully handcrafted using 100% cotton fabric. The outside features geometric dots in shades of green, while the real beauty lies within the bag. Take a peek inside, and you will see that this bag is lined with vintage fabric, with a whimsical print of butterflies and florals! This bag has been constructed with interfacing for durability and form, with careful attention to topstitched detailing for a polished and stylish look. It measures approximately 7\"x7\"x2\" with 14\" handles. A magnetic snap closure keeps your belongings secure. ','purse-tote-vintage-bag.jpg','purse-tote-vintage-in.jpg',0,3,10),
(311,'Mini Yoga Magnets - set of 3',4,'Cute as a button!  Strong, 1/2\" magnets from your favourite online yoga supplier ;) FREE shipping to Canada/Continental US!','minimagnets0002.JPG','',0,8,8),
(324,'Green Drawstring Gift Bag',5,'A roomy, drawstring bag.  Perfect for gift-giving, or for keeping a child\'s toys in one place for home storage or travel!  Measures approximately 11\" x 21\".  Decorative beads on drawstring.  Not recommended for children 3 and under, due to small parts.','baggiftgreen2.jpg','',0,14,9),
(341,'Custom Backpack',0,'This diaper bag was custom-made according to my client\'s specifications for size and features.  A zippered outer pocket, a divider inside with ample pocket space for various items such as baby toys and diapers.  This bag also included a keyclip and magnetic snap closure on the flap of the bag.  A zippered \"wet bag\" completed the set.  ','shannonsbag5.jpg','shannonsbag2.jpg',0,18,18),
(323,'Green Drawstring Gift Bag',5,'A roomy, drawstring bag.  Perfect for gift-giving, or for keeping a child\'s toys in one place for home storage or travel!  Measures approximately 11\" x 21\".  Decorative beads on drawstring.  Not recommended for children 3 and under, due to small parts.','baggiftgreen.jpg','',0,14,8),
(315,'Gift Baskets, Custom-made!',0,'You choose the price of the gift basket, and let me know the \"theme\", and I will do the rest!  I have created baskets of gifts for baby showers, birthdays, co-workers, weddings, anniversaries, graduations, thank-you gifts and more! Can be sent/delivered to you, or directly to the recipient.  Gift-giving has never been easier.  Perfect for any occasion and all budgets! ','elainegiftbasket 002.jpg','elainegiftbasket 007.jpg',0,21,1),
(316,'Faux Suede Messenger Bag',0,'<font color=red>Sorry, this item has been purchased.</font>  This gorgeous bag is made of a luxurious brown faux suede fabric, and lined in 100% cotton.  The bag features a large main compartment, a large flat pocket on the front, and a small pocket inside to keep small items like keys and credit cards handy.  The flap of the bag closes with a magnetic snap to keep your items secure. Measures approx. 17”x12”x3”. The strap is completely adjustable for that perfect fit!Carefully handcrafted with attention to detail and design.  This bag is truly unique and functional!  (Comes empty. Shown in second photo filled with large texts to illustrate how roomy this bag is!).\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n','suedebag1.jpg','suedebag4.jpg',0,18,7),
(328,'Giraffe Drawstring Gift Bag',5,'A roomy, drawstring bag featuring adorable giraffes! Perfect for gift-giving, or for keeping a child\'s toys in one place for home storage or travel! Measures approximately 10\" x 19\". Decorative beads on drawstring. Not recommended for children 3 and under, due to small parts.','baggiftgiraffe.jpg','',0,14,10),
(329,'Blue Drawstring Gift Bag',5,'A roomy, drawstring bag featuring fish, boats, starfish, kites and more! Perfect for gift-giving, or for keeping a child\'s toys in one place for home storage or travel! Measures approximately 11\" x 14\". Decorative beads on drawstring. Not recommended for children 3 and under, due to small parts.','baggiftblue.jpg','',0,14,11),
(363,'\"Green Tea\" necklace',18,'Take a sip of green tea, and your tastebuds immediately respond to the unique fragrant flavour.  As you cradle the cup of tea in your hands and let the warmth take over, you are left with a feeling of health and vitality.  <p>That is the feeling I was trying to capture when I created this necklace.  Each bead was hand chosen and carefully placed in a specific sequence to create a beautiful and unique necklace.  The large bead at the centre is smooth to the touch, just as the perfect cup of tea is soothing to the soul. \r\n\r\n<p>Handcrafted using high quality beads on a strong wire, securely attached to a lobster clasp and loop.  The necklace, measured from end-to-end is approximately 17.5\" long, with a 2\" extension chain to let you choose the length. <p>Shipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. Will ship worldwide!\r\n','neckgreen.jpg','neckgreenCU.jpg',0,4,2),
(369,'\"Blue Bird\" (matte)',20,'This little birdie is the bringer of good news! Do you have some exciting news to share with a loved one? Celebrating a special event? This little bird will carry your message in style, specially gift-wrapped and personalized with a note of your choice!  <p>\r\nHandcrafted using high quality beads on a strong wire, securely attached to a lobster claw clasp. The necklace, measured from end-to-end is approximately 20\" long, with a 2\" extension chain to let you choose the length!\r\n<p>\r\nShipping to Canada/continental USA included in price. \r\n','neckbirdmatte.JPG','neckbirdmatteCU.JPG',0,4,3),
(372,'Gift Certificates',0,'Gift certificates may be purchased in any denomination!  Either a hard-copy gift certificate will be mailed to the recipient, or if it\'s a last minute gift that needs to get there QUICK, an online gift certificate will be e-mailed. Each gift certificate is sent with your own personalized message, and anonymous gift-giving may also be arranged. How\'s that for good karma? ;)  FREE SHIPPING TO US/CANADA!','','',0,22,1);
